# DormBnB – Lahore’s Student Hostel Marketplace

Building a high-end, functional web application similar to Airbnb, specifically for students in Lahore, Pakistan to find hostels based on proximity to their universities.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Since this is built from scratch, I'll be using Vite + React for the framework and Vanilla CSS for styling (as requested, avoiding Tailwind CSS). I'll also use `react-leaflet` for the interactive map and `react-router-dom` for navigating between the search results and hostel detail pages.
> Please review this technical stack and the proposed structure. Let me know if you would like me to use Next.js instead, or if the Vite + React approach sounds good to you!

## Proposed Changes

We will bootstrap the application using Vite and scaffold the following components and pages.

### Core Application & Routing
Setup routing and layout for the application.

#### [NEW] `package.json`
Setup Vite, React, React Router, React Leaflet, and standard icons (`lucide-react`).

#### [NEW] `src/App.jsx`
Implement `react-router-dom` with routes for `<Home />` and `<HostelDetail />`.

---

### Styling & Aesthetics (Vanilla CSS)
Implementing clean, modern, and trustworthy themes using Lahore Green and Clean White.

#### [NEW] `index.html`
Link Google Fonts (Inter/Montserrat).

#### [NEW] `src/index.css`
A comprehensive stylesheet with CSS variables for colors, typography, soft shadows, and layout utilities.

---

### Pages

#### [NEW] `src/pages/Home.jsx`
The split-view interface with the Smart Hero Search, Filters, Hostel List on the left, and the Interactive Map on the right.

#### [NEW] `src/pages/HostelDetail.jsx`
A deep-dive page featuring a full photo gallery, exact map location, and a section for "University Proximity."

---

### Components

#### [NEW] `src/components/HeroSearch.jsx`
A prominent search bar allowing users to search by University Name with a "Near Me" button triggering geolocation.

#### [NEW] `src/components/FilterChips.jsx`
Filter options for Gender, Room Type, and Amenities.

#### [NEW] `src/components/HostelCard.jsx`
Displays hostel data with an image carousel, price/month, distance from university, a 'Quick Call' button (using `tel:`), and a WhatsApp button.

#### [NEW] `src/components/InteractiveMap.jsx`
A full-height interactive Leaflet map that reflects the pinned locations of the filtered hostels.

---

### Data Models & Logic

#### [NEW] `src/data/mockData.js`
Sample data generator including:
- "Green View Hostel, Johar Town, 2km from UMT."
- "Premium Residency, Faisal Town, 1km from FAST."
- "LUMS Executive Hostel, DHA Phase 5, 0.5km from LUMS."

#### [NEW] `src/utils/filterLogic.js`
JavaScript function to filter hostels based on university name and selected filter chips.

## Open Questions

> [!QUESTION]
> For the map, I will use open-source map tiles from OpenStreetMap via Leaflet instead of Google Maps to avoid API key requirements for this build. Is this acceptable?

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Build output check (`npm run build`) to ensure successful compilation.
- Ensure Vite development server starts without warnings.

### Manual Verification
- Manually test functionality: verify Smart Hero Search filters the list properly by university.
- Test geolocation to ensure "Near Me" requests browser permission.
- Check responsive behavior of the split-view interface.
- Ensure 'Call' button uses `tel:` and 'WhatsApp' redirects correctly.
- Test navigation between 'Home' and 'Hostel Detail' pages.
